CNI 94156 A005 L3 call interworking with 732 and 937
    [Documentation]
    ...    The CNI-94156 is introduced to remove coupling between CNI-78446 and CB007552.
    ...    CB007552 introduced support of two dedicated BWP. actMultipleDedicatedBWPs
    ...    CNI-78446 Change CB007552 connection procedure to support legacy Qualcomm UEs . ueConnectionEstablishmentMode=useInitialBwp
    ...    5GC000937 feature reuses CB007552 introduced support of two dedicated BWP and extends it.
    ...    5GC000937 UE power saving: Dynamic bandwidth part adaptation for TDD FR1 actPowerSavingBWP=true
    ...    1.[Configuration]:
    ...    gnb1 enable 7552, enable 937 , enable 2267.
    ...    gnb2 disable 7552, disable 937, enable 732.
    ...    The flag of 7552 enable should be no impact to the function.
    ...    gnb1 : TDD cell1 TDD cell2
    ...    gnb2 : TDD cell3 TDD cell4 FDD cell 11 FDD cell12
    ...    Cell id=1 gnb=1 pci=16:2 tac=200 tdd_cell=on band=n77 nr_arfcn=661400:661400 ssbFre=660000 chBw=100MHz powersaving=true
    ...    Cell id=2 gnb=1 pci=16:3 tac=200 tdd_cell=on band=n77 nr_arfcn=650000:650000 chBw=100MHz powersaving=true
    ...    Cell id=11 gnb=2 pci=20:0 tac=200 tdd_cell=off band=n28 nr_arfcn=153400:143400 ssbFre=368430 chBw=15MHz powersaving=false
    ...    [CA Configuration]:
    ...    Cell 11 have one intergnb CA relationship gnb1 Cell1.
    ...    Cell 1 have 3 intergnb CA relationships gnb2 Cell3, gnb2 cell4 and gnb2 cell12.
    ...    2.Test Case Steps:
    ...      a. UE1 attach to gnb2 cell-11 and start both UL/DL traffic. check IE.
    ...      b. Trigger 732 RRE to same Cell. check IE.
    ...      c. Trigger HO from gnb2_cell11 to gnb1_cell1. check IE.
    ...      d. Trigger 2267 RRE to gnb1 Cell2 from gnb1 Cell1. check IE.
    ...      e. Deregister UE.
    ...      f. UE2 attach to gnb1 cell-1 with 937 and start both UL/DL traffic. check IE.
    ...      g. Decrease traffic to Trigger BWP Switch to Powersaving BWP.
    ...      h. Increase Traffic to Trigger BWP Switch to Dedicate BWP.
